{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 18, :comments ["<b>Upon the bread.</b> On account of the bread — an obligation for the bread (Sifra; Menachot 45)." "<b>And their meal-offering and their drink-offerings.</b> According to the rule of the meal-offering and drink-offerings specified for every animal in the passage of drink-offerings: three tenths for the bull, two tenths for the ram, and one tenth for the lamb — this is the meal-offering; and the drink-offerings: half a hin for the bull, a third of a hin for the ram, and a quarter of a hin for the lamb."], :book :leviticus, :voice :rashi, :lang :en, :chapter 23, :notes {}, :source-witnesses nil, :timestamp "2026-08-02T09:07:58.229080181Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}